{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/NGDD_Steam_Store_About_AboutTheColony2044.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world of bunny societies, existence was shattered when an evil pharmaceutical company, known for its sinister experiments, bioengineered a virus that unleashed a catastrophic zombie outbreak. In the aftermath of the outbreak, you find yourself leading a group of survivors in a world where fluffy tails and twitching noses now hide a dark and dangerous secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_B_Crafting.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFT TOOLS AND WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive and thrive in a post-apocalyptic world! Gather materials, craft essential tools, and create powerful weapons to defend your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Fight_Off_Hoards.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT OFF HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your colonists to fend off waves of infected! Craft weapons, fortify your defenses, and use tactical combat to survive against ever-growing hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_C_Colony.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GROW YOUR COLONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and upgrade your colony by constructing new buildings, gathering essential resources, and training your colonists to improve their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_D_Cure.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE SECRET LABORATORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture beyond your colony into distant, dangerous worlds, searching for hidden laboratories that hold valuable research pages.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2596530?t=1745874946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/2f78665d489c3868576e1ffc00bf3263e8557377/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745874946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745874946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745874946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/NGDD_Steam_Store_Banner_Discord.gif?t=1745874946\" /><br>Join our community on Discord to chat with the developers and other players!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/NGDD_Steam_Store_About_AboutTheColony2044.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world of bunny societies, existence was shattered when an evil pharmaceutical company, known for its sinister experiments, bioengineered a virus that unleashed a catastrophic zombie outbreak. In the aftermath of the outbreak, you find yourself leading a group of survivors in a world where fluffy tails and twitching noses now hide a dark and dangerous secret. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_B_Crafting.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFT TOOLS AND WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive and thrive in a post-apocalyptic world! Gather materials, craft essential tools, and create powerful weapons to defend your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Fight_Off_Hoards.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT OFF HORDES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare your colonists to fend off waves of infected! Craft weapons, fortify your defenses, and use tactical combat to survive against ever-growing hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_C_Colony.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GROW YOUR COLONY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and upgrade your colony by constructing new buildings, gathering essential resources, and training your colonists to improve their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/extras/Steam_D_Cure.gif?t=1745874946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE SECRET LABORATORIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture beyond your colony into distant, dangerous worlds, searching for hidden laboratories that hold valuable research pages.</p>","developers":["Nexrage Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2596530/header.jpg?t=1745874946","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096894,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile